# the Chords page (ENV four times): the kind of chord, the voicing; Drift and Root as on their own pages.
# Hypnos (01) is A Aeolian on its home chord: Am7 (A C E G).
wait 800
expect chordiv 2193
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
expect view 4
expect par92 2
expect par93 0
# ninths: 1 3 7 9 (the fifth out)
turn K1 3
expect par92 5
wait 200
expect chordiv 0x40D
shot chords_9ths.png
# triads: three tones, the root doubled
turn K1 -2
expect par92 3
wait 200
expect chordiv 2069
# dub: the minor 9 shape, the same on any chord (EDIT: the next chord)
turn K1 4
expect par92 7
wait 200
expect chordiv 2117
tap EDIT
wait 4000
expect chordiv 1061
# fourths: 1 4 b7 b3, an m11
turn K1 1
expect par92 7
wait 200
expect chordiv 1061
# open: drop 2 keeps the notes, spreads them
turn K2 1
expect par93 1
wait 200
expect chordiv 1061
# Loop: how many chords repeat (Root is the Global page's)
turn K4 2
expect par150 4
expect edited 1
# by hand from here too (a pad page)
press SEL
tap ENV
release SEL
expect par89 1
press SEL
tap ENV
release SEL
expect par89 0
